00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:21.600
being reported from that country, quote, reduced&nbsp;
testing and case reporting in China and minimal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:26.940
sharing of viral genomic sequence data could delay&nbsp;
the identification of new variants of concern if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:31.020
they arise. So there's a few different things&nbsp;
that I think are important to talk about here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.840
And one of the things that I want to just remind&nbsp;
people when it comes to transparency from China,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:46.200
if you look right now at the official reports of&nbsp;
data from China, China since the start of the PAN,&nbsp;&nbsp;

