00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:05.880
suffering from serious confusion to believe that&nbsp;
these numbers are even remotely connected to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:10.260
reality of COVID in China. Another interesting&nbsp;
thing, if you look at the official data,&nbsp;&nbsp;

