effectiveness of that policy is a question mark,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:16.440
I think is the point doesn't mean we shouldn't do&nbsp;
anything, doesn't mean we shouldn't be concerned.&nbsp;&nbsp;

